        "Angel hair pasta",
        "Roasted asparagus"
      ]
    },
    "chicken_kebabs": {
      "description": "Juicy, seasoned chicken grilled with colorful vegetables until lightly charred, then served with a cool, tangy sauce.",
      "pairings": [
        "Warm pita",
        "Tomato and cucumber salad"
